{"4966730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Powder Park", "steam_appid": 4966730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Somewhere in the mountains, a resort is waiting to be born.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/abb0830bd87c582b16e29ffade071300.poster.avif?t=1788223314\" aria-label=\"Shape the mountain - text on a video showing the landscape be raised, lowered, flattened, then smoothed, before buildings are placed on the flattened area.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/abb0830bd87c582b16e29ffade071300.webm?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/abb0830bd87c582b16e29ffade071300.mp4?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt every slope, carve out bowls and ridgelines, and decide where the mountain rises and falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tuck lodges into the hillside and lay out lifts wherever the terrain calls for them. There's no locked-in blueprint and no single right layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the mountain range your resort calls home: the Pacific Northwest, the Rockies, the Alps, Japan, or Scandinavia. Each one shapes who shows up at your gates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/8858807120c6f8108cd5a69ae1d06742.poster.avif?t=1788223314\" aria-label=\"Watch your resort come alive - text on a video showing guest NPCs walking around and enjoying park amenities like a Cocoa Cabin, and firepits, surrounded by trees lit up with colorful glowing lights.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/8858807120c6f8108cd5a69ae1d06742.webm?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/8858807120c6f8108cd5a69ae1d06742.mp4?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests fill your paths and lodges, ride your runs, and post about their day on PowderGram.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check PowderGram, your resort's own little social feed, for selfies from the summit, grumbling about lift lines, and the odd yeti sighting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/c8e583be741380aa29de1b55d6efccb6.poster.avif?t=1788223314\" aria-label=\"Become the destination - text on a video showing resort guests milling about at a park entrance. A few buildings and lots of trees are visible in the snowy landscape.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/c8e583be741380aa29de1b55d6efccb6.webm?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/c8e583be741380aa29de1b55d6efccb6.mp4?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade lodges, lifts, and amenities to keep guests happy and coming back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advertise your resort to pull in new guests and build your reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice feeds your bottom line. Earn more, build more, and watch your resort become the place people talk about.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/9c55fc95e3ae55e5e6d6a001e36d2d34.poster.avif?t=1788223314\" aria-label=\"Hit the Slopes - text on a video showing a player character jumping and doing a flip on a ski slope.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/9c55fc95e3ae55e5e6d6a001e36d2d34.webm?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/9c55fc95e3ae55e5e6d6a001e36d2d34.mp4?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap on your skis or snowboard and ride the very runs you built, line by line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every carve is a full, physical ride down the mountain you shaped, not a menu you click through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull back with the drone for the big picture, or drop back down and feel the mountain from the inside.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ride with friends</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit a friend's resort and drop in on the very runs they built, riding side by side in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your resort through someone else's eyes, then invite them back to return the favor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat with us!</strong> Powder Park is being built by a small team, including one of the original creators of Ski Resort Tycoon. Come hang out on our Discord, share screenshots of your resort, and tell us what you'd like to see next.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Somewhere in the mountains, a resort is waiting to be born.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/abb0830bd87c582b16e29ffade071300.poster.avif?t=1788223314\" aria-label=\"Shape the mountain - text on a video showing the landscape be raised, lowered, flattened, then smoothed, before buildings are placed on the flattened area.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/abb0830bd87c582b16e29ffade071300.webm?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/abb0830bd87c582b16e29ffade071300.mp4?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt every slope, carve out bowls and ridgelines, and decide where the mountain rises and falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tuck lodges into the hillside and lay out lifts wherever the terrain calls for them. There's no locked-in blueprint and no single right layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the mountain range your resort calls home: the Pacific Northwest, the Rockies, the Alps, Japan, or Scandinavia. Each one shapes who shows up at your gates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragra