.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/c8e583be741380aa29de1b55d6efccb6.mp4?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade lodges, lifts, and amenities to keep guests happy and coming back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advertise your resort to pull in new guests and build your reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice feeds your bottom line. Earn more, build more, and watch your resort become the place people talk about.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/9c55fc95e3ae55e5e6d6a001e36d2d34.poster.avif?t=1788223314\" aria-label=\"Hit the Slopes - text on a video showing a player character jumping and doing a flip on a ski slope.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/9c55fc95e3ae55e5e6d6a001e36d2d34.webm?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966730/extras/9c55fc95e3ae55e5e6d6a001e36d2d34.mp4?t=1788223314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap on your skis or snowboard and ride the very runs you built, line by line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every carve is a full, physical ride down the mountain you shaped, not a menu you click through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull back with the drone for the big picture, or drop back down and feel the mountain from the inside.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ride with friends</strong> </p><ul class=